<title>SPAIN: SOCCER SHOWCASE-ROUTES TO THE SPANISH CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-ROUTES TO THE SPANISH CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barcelona and Real Betis took the following routes to Saturday's Spanish Cup Final:</p>
<p>Rounds 1-3: Byes</p>
<p>Round 4:</p>
<p>First leg: Barcelona 3, Real Madrid  2</p>
<p>Second leg: Real Madrid 1, Barcelona 1 (aggregate: 4-3)</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>First leg: Atletico Madrid 2, Barcelona 2 Second leg: Barcelona 5, Atletico Madrid 4</p>
<p>(agg: 7-6)</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>First leg: Las Palmas 0, Barcelona 4</p>
<p>Second leg: Barcelona 3, Las Palmas 0</p>
<p>(agg: 7-0)</p>
<p>- - -</p>
<p>Round 1: Bye</p>
<p>Round 2:</p>
<p>First leg: Ecija 1, Real Betis 2</p>
<p>Second leg: Real Betis 2, Ecija 0</p>
<p>(agg: 4-1)</p>
<p>Round 3:</p>
<p>First leg:  Granada 0, Real Betis 1</p>
<p>Second leg: Real Betis 3, Granada  0</p>
<p>(agg: 4-0)</p>
<p>Round 4:</p>
<p>First leg: Tenerife 0, Real Betis 2</p>
<p>Second leg: Real Betis 3, Tenerife 0</p>
<p>(agg: 5-0)</p>
<p>Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>First leg: Real Betis 2, Rayo Vallecano 0</p>
<p>Second leg: Rayo Vallecano 1, Real Betis 2</p>
<p>(agg: 4-1)</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>First leg: Real Betis 1, Celta Vigo 0 Second leg: Celta Vigo 1, Real Betis 1</p>
<p>(agg: 2-1)</p>
</text>
